{"id":751,"date":"2025-09-24T16:54:08","date_gmt":"2025-09-24T16:54:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/?page_id=751"},"modified":"2026-08-16T18:29:32","modified_gmt":"2026-08-16T18:29:32","slug":"about-us","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/about-us\/","title":{"rendered":"About Us"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"751\" class=\"elementor elementor-751\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4f7486 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a4f7486\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbaab22 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cbaab22\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-279065a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"279065a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">At Tech Sphere Academy, we believe \nthat world-class education \nshould be accessible to \neveryone.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e4b29e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e4b29e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our mission is to equip Africans with the skills and <br \/>confidence to thrive in the booming technology <br \/>and digital industries.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1831d20 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"1831d20\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\