pe=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ee5cae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ee5cae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65b5aeb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"65b5aeb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"776\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-776x1200.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1007\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-776x1200.png 776w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-323x500.png 323w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-194x300.png 194w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-768x1188.png 768w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-48x75.png 48w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Rectangle-96-480x742.png 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 480px, (max-width:776px) 100vw, 776px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-133b8d2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"133b8d2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-67e505d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"67e505d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Whether your ambition lies in \nProduct Management, Cybersecurity, \nData Science, AI &amp; Automation, or even \nbecoming a thriving Content Creator, \nwe\u2019ve designed our courses to be:<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46ce1c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"46ce1c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li><strong>Practical:<\/strong> Learn through hands-on projects and real-world scenarios.<\/li><li><strong>Affordable:<\/strong> Get high-quality education without heavy tuition fees, thanks to our scholarship programs.<\/li><li><strong>Opportunity-Driven:<\/strong> Connect directly to internships and job placements locally and internationally.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-456d966 elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"456d966\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/scholarship.tsacademyonline.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Apply For Scholarship<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73464b5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"73464b5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b81469 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6b81469\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"374\" height=\"82\" src=\"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Group-267.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1045\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Group-267.png 374w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Group-267-300x66.png 300w, https:\/\/tsacademyonline.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Group-267-150x33.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width:767px) 374px, 374px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-394fe02 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"394fe02\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce3233d e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ce3233d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6e68ae7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6e68ae7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Our core mission at Tech Sphere (TS) Academy is to bridge the critical gap between local Nigerian talent and the vast international opportunities within the digital economy.\u00a0<\/strong><\/p><p>We are dedicated to empowering every learner to compete and thrive on a global stage, ensuring that ambition is met with accessible pathways to success.<br \/>We understand the challenges many face; the skepticism, intimidation of technical jargon, and the feeling of being underleveraged in current careers. That&#8217;s why TS Academy is built as an innovative, supportive learning platform. We&#8217;re here to help you dive into tech and marketing without feeling overwhelmed.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-193d017 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"193d017\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c306db5 text-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-tp-heading-title\" data-id=\"c306db5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"tp-heading-title.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"heading heading_style heading_style6abc246879a80 style-1 \"  data-tp-gsap-heading-text=\"\" data-tp-gsap-sub-heading-text=\"\"><div class=\"sub-style\" ><div class=\"head-title \" > <h2  class=\"heading-title   \"  data-hover=\"Why Choose TS Academy?\">Why Choose TS Academy?<span class=\"title-s \">  <\/span><\/h2><\/div><div class=\"sub-heading\"><h3 class=\"heading-sub-title  \"> At TS Academy, we\u2019re more than an academy. We\u2019re your partner in growth.  Here\u2019s why thousands of learners choose us: <\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c80f675 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c80f675\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-344804d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"344804d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-09cfc7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"09cfc7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Personalized <br>\nMentorship<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7b1493 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a7b1493\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Get one-on-one guidance from <br \/>seasoned industry experts who are committed to your success.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a050cc1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a050cc1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d7ca25 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2d7ca25\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Beginner-Friendly <br>\nLearning<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fff338e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fff338e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>No prior tech background? <br \/>No problem! Our courses start <br \/>from the fundamentals, guiding <br \/>you step-by-step.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e29b526 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e29b526\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d300fd9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d300fd9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Accountability <br>\nCheck-ins:<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c86391f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c86391f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Stay motivated and on track with regular check-ins and a supportive learning community.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4af19bd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4af19bd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e12d8fe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e12d8fe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e99e868 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e99e868\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Personalized <br>\nMentorship<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12e7063 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"12e7063\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our robust curriculum is packed <br \/>with practical, project-based <br \/>learning to build a portfolio that <br \/>truly stands out.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38c9938 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"38c9938\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdb5bdc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cdb5bdc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Career <br>\nConnections<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c71c1d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c71c1d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We don&#8217;t just teach; we connect! <br \/>Benefit from exclusive access to <br \/>internships and job boards to <br \/>fast-track your career.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ed0bab e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8ed0bab\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7daa99d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7daa99d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Financial <br>\nFreedom<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-83137ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"83137ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our goal is to get you closer to <br \/>financial freedom and your dream career through in-demand skills.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1872eaf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1872eaf\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ele